# A gap pays once per combo: Patricia's Green Line with the carry-on, a
# bench, ollie, the short seat wall and at its end across onto the long one beside it. The second
# seat wall would be PATRICIA'S SEAT WALL again: it neither pays nor adds to the multiplier, so the
# combo is BS 50-50 + PATRICIA'S BENCH + BS 50-50 + PATRICIA'S SEAT WALL + BS 50-50: 150 + 250 +
# 120 + 300 + 441 (the third 50-50 at 50%), x5 = 6,305 (6,320 before the squeezed city; it was 9,018 x6 with the gap twice; 6,390
# before phase 24's wider clean landing, whose clean landings keep a little more speed).
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 10 teleport -219.72 429.80 9.75 340.4
cmd 12 set skater.vel.x -1.7679
cmd 12 set skater.vel.y 4.9777
hold ollie 10..39
hold ollie 129..143
tap grind 68..135 every 6
tap grind 178..233 every 6
bot balance
run 1000
expect event gap{id=patricia_wall} count == 1
expect event grindStart{line=ledge_-222_438_b} within 230..234
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50 + PATRICIA'S BENCH + BS 50-50 + PATRICIA'S SEAT WALL + BS 50-50,points=6305,multiplier=5} within 768..772
expect no event bail
